BlastEm snapshot packaging
==========================

This package tracks the Git master snapshot at commit
2dd605c6e27971f67ce5b8363cc858964f99aa50 (2026-08-21).

Create the matching orig tarball from a clean repository with:

    git archive --format=tar \
      --prefix=blastem-0.6.3.4+git20260821.2dd605c/ \
      2dd605c6e27971f67ce5b8363cc858964f99aa50 | \
      xz -9e > ../blastem_0.6.3.4+git20260821.2dd605c.orig.tar.xz

The snapshot version patch makes the exact source revision visible through
"blastem -v". The build-flags patch ensures that dpkg-buildflags hardening and
reproducibility flags are not overwritten by the upstream Makefile.
